  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>, then&nbsp;<br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is an odd function<br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
  }
